{
  "6": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:cc44d384cec3b6067b0254f1cd9247db967a4f28d50f01026f6f0a56767b8dcc",
      "text": "Ohh? Ohhh!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5c316e6159e2386e544465b37c7f3744487e7d2c1f66692d4d6f8a31e193146f",
      "text": "Hey, hey! Palpebra looks kind of\ndifferent lately! What's going on?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f885e8ba53314261c3d8bec5d848a3bee750b8a95065b64ca8a8601897eafe0a",
      "text": "Huh? Denah, you don't know about\nValentine's Fest?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "18": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:97071dfe5880e6391e452cac6e9962bb69af68e109cd600852cb857d9e55d9f9",
      "text": "Ahh~! I heard people in the north of\nmy world have that custom.\nSounds fun, I'm in!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "21": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d17028538b56dbe4f8ca8bdd032444aec6294f01b15560e16f6ae0fd306a132a",
      "text": "If that's decided... heh heh heh,\nwe'll need preparations...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "25": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a40f4fcdbd78814b1cc5f8f0e59d9d355e14c6dc4dabca55a18b29d61bea2d06",
      "text": "A festival demands fitting garb, does\nit not? I am the Maiden of the KING OF\nVOID AND DARKNESS! A Maiden, I say!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "29": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:602cc960dcfe3fd4b1577c8e8ddf7856042738d46ae636c6c3989ac514e428ff",
      "text": "You just want an excuse to get\nnew clothes, right...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "33": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:de7e3615045aa1bbe8e15ca16f8231f5764f463090ac43694f11cf4b88fe9f8f",
      "text": "You could say that!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "36": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:60f6fab08de1da5ffd01fb2037f17f5d3571b10bd4ba388afb039933573800a9",
      "text": "Heh, just watch! I shall reveal my\nnew form, befitting a festival\nswirling with love and passion...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "40": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:35118b623b065ea645974475d6a581fc0469f83fa50d8aa5b2f27e7457fb3b92",
      "text": "And holding an unveiling party for it\nis so Denah...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "44": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:549a15b7f46903a32e8ed5289d43535080a05dd112f21ecbc57ae0ed15d1f69d",
      "text": "I'm really looking forward to it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "48": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9c352c2306b88292d6faeee3e7a4a68b98cdcbf11f082140e94f473ac6423c1b",
      "text": "Same~.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "52": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ee7ed96473ba8b764bff0b7c2ba6c48d1a77ea3861eb5f21389c5b04ec30f7cc",
      "text": "...Wait, why Shota?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "56": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e130a11d75b0d429c3d249faf7990295f0726efecefac5837964355affd39ae6",
      "text": "I helped too! She wanted to bring in\nShibuya style, that sort of thing!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "59": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:1ea647e2c3ec993510b653254609678cc441ab29d37f2bb1dddbca61fa6cfe1c",
      "text": "...But in the end she and Yuki got\nhyped on their own and I got kicked\nout, you know???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "64": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:19b517361eb57764a7697d472e997d14b542613b5097b1cdf344729b2e76a304",
      "text": "I-I see...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "70": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:28c628d2be70179bc68b97fafd7feec7fb0b4aec01076ae1029b7d99ddd77efc",
      "text": "Noooooooo!!!\nI don't wanna show it!!\nIt totally doesn't suit me!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "74": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:752bac0e92c058bd8fd48cc6f6afbdf45bb07de29357649fbeec034f6a6fa719",
      "text": "Hmm... I think it's nice, but...\nShould we call it off, then? You\ndon't have to force yourself.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "79": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:257ebc71071daa7804e43ae44a3847753e02fb82be4c2e8a8f46fab8691cd520",
      "text": "That's no good either! I don't wanna\ntrouble Alk and the others, or the\npeople who made it!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "82": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aef36fcbd4bee775ce9b937a4980d25e1775752bc219c40982ee4ec17dd008b5",
      "text": "............Then let's go together.\nYou can hide behind me at first.\nCome on!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "86": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c7eeca53b9b77c193b43bc8827ee615425224b660b7c6d90a519d7ed6d48f64a",
      "text": "Eeeeeeek!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "91": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8cb4addaeb068f0b2a5e61a2669bd15185c3f83184868ca6fa5039627164276c",
      "text": "Uuuuuuuuuu!!!\nCourage! Courage!! COURAGE!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "95": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5e9cd92ab9164e4653c4737e097056fc225c8a8264a50afc7ce14b3a65e08f77",
      "text": "I-I am Denah... Selphis! Be dyed\nin my king's darkness... w-white?!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "99": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d3f125b5e8cb8335b28025c6020953f5e7cd181590fb899d636f51eb30b1eabb",
      "text": "I might be done for...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "103": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:33d1ad24a50227adc3c2b431c117c35d599c1aa1f875abbfb201a1be74575a78",
      "text": "No, you look cute...? Is this a gap\nthing...? Huh...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "109": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4e1f6f9fbb31cad8d7e97b998d9cafd187fee29fac46c5ac8f35027d47db31d0",
      "text": "So cute. Yes. Really. It's so cute.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "114": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:87868ba041ef830ca1332c40fa8e0350b1686f62150df819bd8d5b282c7a97b3",
      "text": "That's what's wrong with it!!!\nIt's not my taste, this!! It's\nWHITE!! It's too SWEET!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "119": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:0646f79ab766b86a025b35d9197009439838493fd16787d5dc30d29a44e813fc",
      "text": "Huh? Why? It's awesome. You look like\nan angel or something, right?\nCould even beat an idol, maybe?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "125": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:9a2a4608aad631245911b7d9513edcf90607dc209c2ca838bdc158b82ed6f088",
      "text": "Eeeek!! The worst possible review!!\nI'm taking it off!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "130": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:392735f16cc2d052bcf2c84d5c841eb5e7514ae25854728f69d9594c34cb11a5",
      "text": "D-Denah...! We're outside, this is\nbad...!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "134": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:630b56f781f7a1799283409fcfc38a4cbdf8c32beeda485e38c3247e71c2eb49",
      "text": "A-and anyway, I expected something\nsharper, like what Gaean government\npeople wear! Why frills!?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "138": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:108e6e2d854d1723422b90632410c3db6d99b151cf0a25775f3b7a63ca6503b1",
      "text": "I think you can bring out a clothing\nworld's feel, Denah.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "141": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:94f6cca00a89b900c470191854b6acf908b417cd6d054de46a3ee2abccbc39c1",
      "text": "They probably did make something\ndifferent from what you expected, but\nthis kind of world really did exist.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "145": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4affe8c7a11007dd7a86b30120482ec1433d5726dac1562ecd342eb17f09b27a",
      "text": "This outfit's world... hmm...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "148": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d4aec7fd35393ec88735f93a2598edadadfd257ed2279e52be7bbcb7b7d40f23",
      "text": "...W-well, in Shibuya manga, someone\nlike usual me wears clothes with\nlots of frills, I guess...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "152": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:2469a7c5f952c9ee2e10a6f7b44c9fa6d223c5650d593fdeae65bd30a29f3931",
      "text": "And I think you could wear this\noutfit coolly, Denah.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "156": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:bf78ba9845677c87eadba188c6566fdd359bebebe9b45125f8666be86a49f7b6",
      "text": "True? Now I'm kind of starting to\nthink so too...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "160": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:e3ed5ad709279a6a032f1fda18a3ec39f7da616b78c2ddd144c88d419a746f45",
      "text": "Hmm, no, but my usual catchphrases\ndon't quite fit this world...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "163": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d0da095cf27909f6590892e0597cefc409351528105e916f66dcb61eb9dfbbc0",
      "text": "Hey, everyone.\nI need your help with something—",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "168": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:12cc56af21f30881c989bd1ac042560687cf4a7fcafb4697f70cefcbcd40c119",
      "text": "Okay, ready whenever!\nShota, I'm counting on you!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "171": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:aa42069a4dcb1b734ba788326c4fa8515345567cb64f4f4ce6d7fddb4849db26",
      "text": "Heh, are you sure? Touch me and\nyou'll get burned.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "176": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:48d42e0217f4bcff6cac35a72a5678eedeaabe445a85479464fc87d2a77c7697",
      "text": "Ohh...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "181": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ef6360a5100004f9309939c88db4a5b92a3044724ca4f045b5748005521abe69",
      "text": "Hmm... It's very edgy-teenager.\nBut as a direction, I wonder...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "185": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4ee1c3ee37fca956d2183848969bdb10d0bc9cbe45478907a2ff063f92a6bbc2",
      "text": "Hmmm... Honestly, I don't\nhate it, but it doesn't\nfeel like this outfit~?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "190": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:51e9fee2852933b1de9cae113448ca3c159ab138572771ca810d200849ae2183",
      "text": "Gh... I lost...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "194": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:fda9e45235f2520ac88c51db8705487b6f04270263fdc9649c50b6f4a12e9ad9",
      "text": "To what???",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "198": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:a6a967b58b6e9ebc1ca0764d82e424839f82fb6037c09446b82abed802281074",
      "text": "Okay, next, Alk!\nYou have an idea, of course?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "202": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4b52484a82e968c42136ec016dbebd0e318bba0f37885454fa0fe75189963fb4",
      "text": "I have to do it too!? Uhhh... hmm...\nI don't have powers like you two.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "206": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3744df71070fbb8b0f6988226dfd4901fe64cc076c39d2ee7f068fa74d4dbb8e",
      "text": "If we match Denah's mood right now,\nI think it'll have to be something\nfragile and fleeting.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "211": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:271ec07fa7138639ac0c1f4f8e406ea3bf89b6712c748b355844b06be2be769e",
      "text": "Wow, you're totally into it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "217": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5f17769c2593af19efc03090063a8162b990a0ea419a70dd08d64c3ce274dcd1",
      "text": "On the far side of the dark gloom,\nare you there?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "221": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:62ea2e07d96d8867034d49498079d32b2f41f74c5ac92280d80241405877d03e",
      "text": "Oh, that might be it.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "226": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:b9609917e96a137264a91963c2faa92d072dd25f9ea63d0b673020e4f2342374",
      "text": "Right, right! Adopted! See, you had\nit in you! As expected of Alk,\nmy compass!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "231": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:f2187a99c87532f06ebad54340c78ea8e06916a66d9aa05c468f9110ad8f1fcf",
      "text": "What a novel compliment...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "235": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:c8cdba19ec69c392182dd9a91c763c30f695756d60b097fa52b405e07e4b3840",
      "text": "Now then, the main event, Yuki!\nReady...?",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "240": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:d5413c9403ddb1911079ee2fa33a35996a5da82845175272dcff376eaaf4e5fe",
      "text": "Sort of, I guess. Watching Ayumu's\nhelped me figure it out a bit.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "245": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:8f65fe650f6899dc13f655ac036e5f15bc02b43c054bc04809f93d7c2357dff6",
      "text": "Bloom, white world.\nCrystalite End!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "248": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:6d01237171af361702227aba91046a3e18e26c61336582445d475868de1e37c4",
      "text": "Phew...",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "253": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:48811048595c40681bafe3112b651bce559c4ab1e04209ac8925b39e0b27321f",
      "text": "How was that? I thought this might\nbe what you meant.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "258": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:4644cb1905c91a073629b814e4614d7c4c186d3eae5fe50ab566aa951ddff1ee",
      "text": "...Great.",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "264": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:5086c143733d8b03764d37d60c9cbcbfa6e6608718cd2d2c6e7902e49de6384f",
      "text": "The BEST, Yuki!!!! A hundred million\npoints!!! This is it, THIS!!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "266": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:7d3e066d1026938f04c68372b774d85f605b096b4e70c5a5781ef98eaec2dc66",
      "text": "Shibuya style is all restraint and\nstillness, and you're its peak, Yuki!\nSnow, light, breath! Pure vibes!!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "270": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:3817d04dd1ddf6597177f8f38913fe019a21b79ec152133b7c2bceaf6c7d5d0e",
      "text": "Um, being explained is kind of\nembarrassing...!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "274": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:02d5dd9af5c77c2c602c6ddc36abc459534c6ab515bfcfea76d34112923ac413",
      "text": "Come on, everyone, think with me!\nWe have to remix that to suit me!\nYou two did so well, after all!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  },
  "278": {
    "5": {
      "srcHash": "sha256:ae2b35bb877de6c555ad4702b134edadfe5f5fb25b12a712bb02db11d514e1c3",
      "text": "Teach me about your world!",
      "status": "machine"
    }
  }
}
